Architecture reference
----------------------
QAgent's architecture was informed by NVIDIA's
Quantum-Calibration-Agent-Blueprint:
https://github.com/NVIDIA/Quantum-Calibration-Agent-Blueprint

The referenced project is licensed under Apache-2.0. Its source files
identify NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES as the copyright holders.

The architectural reference covers the separation of experiment execution
and storage, model-facing tool organization, centralized runtime data,
and unit/integration test organization. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for the
correspondence with QAgent's modules.

